The liquid-glass tab bar in this repository is a re-implementation of their
Apple-style tabs: the rendering pipeline (backdrop capture, the AGSL
rounded-rect refraction shader, the specular rim highlight, the damped drag
state machine) is adapted from miuix's blur module, whose glass visuals in
turn follow Kyant0's AndroidLiquidGlass.

